# protocol/01 § Joining: creating a private channel is done by the instance issuing Add proposals
# for every eligible device. The test host writes a community-less private channel whose
# channel_members are alice and bob (channel … members=), and alice registers its text group. The
# composition root's AfterRegister runs api.SyncRegisteredGroup AFTER the 201 (protocol/02, POST
# /v1/groups), which proposes bob's device through ds.ProposeAddBatch. The Go harness test
# (TestRegisteringAChannelGroupThroughTheInstanceProposesItsMembers) waits for that Add in the
# instance's store: the scenario itself cannot, because the Add arrives asynchronously and no verb
# here waits for an instance proposal. The join storm's own batching is join_storm_256_batched.
instance dilla
client alice
client bob
channel f7f7f7f7f7f7f7f7f7f7f7f7f7f7f7f7 visibility=private mode=e2ee members=alice,bob
group chat kind=text target=f7f7f7f7f7f7f7f7f7f7f7f7f7f7f7f7 community=none creator=alice
